Package: vabaxos-translate
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: text
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, vabaxos-describe
Description: Translation without Internet
 Translates a written or copied text (Super+Alt+T translates what was
 copied with Ctrl+C) into Italian, English, French, German, Spanish or
 Portuguese, on the computer: the multilingual model of the descriptions
 of pictures (Qwen3.5 0.8B, downloaded once on request) through llama.cpp.
 The translation is said and gets the focus. Good for the meaning, not for
 a text to sign.
